## Approach
- A rotated version of a string will always appear as a substring of the string concatenated with itself.
- First, check if the lengths are equal. If not, return `false`.
- Create a new string `s2 = s + s`.
- Search for `goal` inside `s2`.
- If found, return `true`; otherwise, return `false`.

